WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:19.370
Bird and Kip were at the beach.

2
00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:22.007
"Look at this litter," said Bird.

3
00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:26.888
"I should pick it up."

4
00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:34.358
Bird picked up the litter.

5
00:00:34.359 --> 00:00:39.386
Kip put his toolbox down.

6
00:00:39.387 --> 00:00:45.262
He took out his saw and hammer.

7
00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:49.407
And he started building his boat.

8
00:00:49.408 --> 00:01:01.967
Kip didn't really know how to build it.

9
00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:15.564
But he did the best he could.

10
00:01:15.565 --> 00:01:21.928
"I can't wait to go sailing," he said.

11
00:01:21.929 --> 00:01:24.758
Just then a huge wave came in.

12
00:01:24.759 --> 00:01:27.146
It crashed into Kip's boat.

13
00:01:27.147 --> 00:01:28.893
Splash!

14
00:01:28.894 --> 00:01:31.462
"My boat!" cried Kip.

15
00:01:31.463 --> 00:01:36.991
Bird was dragging a box up the beach.

16
00:01:36.992 --> 00:01:41.108
The wave crashed into Bird.

17
00:01:41.109 --> 00:01:43.004
Sploosh!

18
00:01:43.005 --> 00:01:45.428
Bird fell into the box.

19
00:01:45.429 --> 00:01:52.606
"Squawk!" she cried.

20
00:01:52.607 --> 00:01:56.046
Then the box zoomed straight toward Kip.

21
00:01:56.047 --> 00:01:59.515
"Look out!" cried Bird.

22
00:01:59.516 --> 00:02:01.472
Crash!

23
00:02:01.473 --> 00:02:04.336
Now Kip was in the box too.

24
00:02:04.337 --> 00:02:08.014
And the box was headed for the ocean!
